WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:07.040
I got on the bus with my wife going out to a friend’s house.

2
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:20.320
And my wife looks like she is white—one of them Creoles from up around Natchitoches. [A white man] jumps up and gives her a seat.

3
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.140
I laughed.

4
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.360
I sat right down beside her.

5
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:36.680
Well, we were going out into a black neighborhood; wasn’t too many whites on the bus. [The bus driver] wasn’t ready to start a commotion,

6
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:42.280
so he kept looking at his mirror and mumbling-jumbling . . . But I rode on out there.
